   "fen": "r1bk3r/pBp2ppp/5n2/8/1B6/5N2/P4PPP/2KR3R b - - 0 16",
   "line": [
    "Bxb7+"
   ],
   "spoken": "It isn't mate — the opponent can always block a check with the bishop — so simply win as much material as possible, snapping off the rook with check. When there's no forced mate, take the practical, decisive material rather than hunting a marginally prettier line.",
