   "spoken": "A beautiful defensive idea against the sacrifice — when facing a discovered check, remember you can sometimes use the piece that's already lost to block it and get something back in return. Interposing and then recapturing wins the piece back, reaching an equal opposite-coloured-bishop endgame with drawish tendencies.",
