   "line": [
    "Qb3"
   ],
   "spoken": "A vital lesson on move order — reversing the sequence of a line often completely changes its nature and hands the opponent extra defensive resources. The same moves in a different order can turn a winning attack into nothing, so the order is the idea, not just the moves.",
   "kind": "plan",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
